Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:30:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands through backend command
 routing

Slash-prefixed selected-session input uses a provider command method so backend-native actions such as status and fork are not wrapped into ordinary agent prompts. The default backend implementation reports unsupported commands while Codex answers the supported commands from recorded session state.
